        "original_id": "ce0a6284-741e-5360-99e0-8314b061513b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Minnesota State Mavericks, Minnesota State University, Mankato, NSIC, North Central Conference\n- Mascots and Traditions: Stomper the Maverick, The Minnesota State Rouser\n\nFacts:\n- Minnesota State Mavericks began competition in the NSIC in 2008–09 because the North Central Conference dissolved.\n- Stomper the Maverick is the mascot for the Minnesota State Mavericks athletics teams of Minnesota State University, Mankato, as well as associated club teams and charities.\n- The Minnesota State Rouser is played at all Minnesota State Mavericks athletics games, rallies, and many alumni events.",
